  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Bengaluru: <a href=\"/tag/neuberg+diagnostics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Neuberg Diagnostics</a> announced the consolidation of its <a href=\"/tag/maharashtra+operations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Maharashtra operations</a> with <a href=\"/tag/nm+medical\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NM Medical</a>, bringing both brands under one network.Neuberg said the partnership combines NM Medical's expertise in advanced radiology, cardiology and preventive wellness with Neuberg's specialised capabilities in <a href=\"/tag/genomics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">genomics</a>, metabolomics, proteomics, digital pathology, immunohistochemistry, molecular diagnostics, nephropathology and neuropathology.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The Maharashtra platform will be led by Dr. Nilesh Shah as Chairman while Rahil Shah will serve as CEO, Maharashtra, Preventive Wellness and Africa Operations, <a href=\"/tag/neuberg+group\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Neuberg Group</a>.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>The diagnostic company added that it will expand across Maharashtra through integrated diagnostic centres, advanced pathology laboratories, wellness and collection centres.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 7, 2026 at 05:13 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 7, 2026 at 05:13 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"News